  "summary": "Convertible (19467) rear deck air exhaust: rear plenum shut-off doors (air-outlet louver doors behind the cockpit) with their frame, vacuum actuator, rod linkage and gaskets. The actuator bolts to a support screwed to the door frame; the rod runs through riveted guides to the door crank arms; door gaskets are cemented on. The air outlet grille panel, its screws and nuts install as on the coupe (sheet F20).",
